\title{Competitive programming}

\import{base-macros}

\p{I enjoy recreational competitive programming, especially in [[Haskell]].}
\ul{
  \li{I have [solved about 2600 problems](http://ozark.hendrix.edu/~yorgey/kattis.html) on [Open Kattis](https://open.kattis.com/), over 2000 of them in Haskell.}
  \li{I've written a series of [blog posts about competitive programming in Haskell](https://byorgey.github.io/blog/tag/competitive programming.html).}
  \li{I am the coach of the [[hendrixcollege]] competitive programming team.}
